Condition: Good pre-owned condition — no visible stains, holes, or damage observed.', '[]'::jsonb, '53159', '{"Size":["XS"],"Type":["Tank Top"],"Brand":["Peruvian Connection"],"Color":["Blue"],"Style":["Sleeveless V-Neck Tank Top"],"Season":["Spring","Summer"],"Pattern":["Solid"],"Vintage":["No"],"Handmade":["No"],"Material":["Pima Cotton","Modal"],"Neckline":["V-Neck"],"Occasion":["Casual","Everyday"],"Size Type":["Regular"],"Department":["Women"],"Fabric Type":["51% Pima Cotton, 49% Modal"],"Sleeve Type":["Sleeveless"],"Garment Care":["Hand Wash Cold, Mild Soap, Lay Flat to Dry, Low Iron or Dry Clean"],"Sleeve Length":["Sleeveless"],"Country of Origin":["Peru"]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-17 00:45:09.395927+00'),
('35df61da-404a-5e67-b8ff-1abcba688738', 'd54d2cc8-aa82-4a95-ad3b-e899d7a83454', 'Lauren Ralph Lauren Women''s Cable Knit Crewneck Sweater with Gold Crest Emblem –', 'Lauren Ralph Lauren', NULL, NULL, 'XS', 'Gray', '5.5', NULL, 'Goodwill Outlet Bins — June', NULL, 'listed', NULL, NULL, '735', 'clothing', '7e119e67-4f93-542a-9f12-338dd40bb153', '42.50', '22', '{"chest":17.5,"length":24}'::jsonb, '58% Cotton, 42% Viscose', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Cable Knit Crewneck Sweater', 'Lauren Ralph Lauren Women''s Cable Knit Crewneck Sweater in charcoal gray, size XS. Features an all-over cable knit pattern and a decorative gold bullion crest emblem on the left chest. Made from 58% cotton and 42% viscose. Made in China.

Condition: Good pre-owned condition. The knit body is clean with no holes or stains. The gold crest patch has minor fuzz on the felt backing but is fully intact and securely attached.', '[]'::jsonb, '63866', '{"MPN":["200721293002"],"Size":["XS"],"Type":["Sweater"],"Brand":["Lauren Ralph Lauren"],"Color":["Gray"],"Style":["Cable Knit Crewneck Sweater"],"Season":["Fall","Winter"],"Accents":["Embroidered","Gold-Tone"],"Pattern":["Cable Knit"],"Vintage":["No"],"Features":["Cable Knit","Gold Bullion Crest Patch","Ribbed Cuffs and Hem"],"Material":["Cotton","Viscose"],"Neckline":["Crewneck"],"Occasion":["Casual","Smart Casual"],"Size Type":["Regular"],"Department":["Women"],"Knit Style":["Cable Knit"],"Fabric Type":["58% Cotton, 42% Viscose"],"Sleeve Length":["Long Sleeve"],"Country of Origin":["China"]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-16 22:39:03.537627+00'),
('f98c60b2-a2a6-5382-b300-e0d710c658e7', 'd54d2cc8-aa82-4a95-ad3b-e899d7a83454', 'Greyson Men''s Gray Performance Golf Pants Size 34', 'Greyson', NULL, NULL, '34', 'Gray', '7.99', NULL, 'Westwood Estate Sale', NULL, 'listed', NULL, NULL, '710', 'clothing', 'fc8cd104-dcdc-56c2-baed-e725eecc5260', '42.50', 'WEARING', '{"rise":11,"waist":17,"inseam":10}'::jsonb, 'Performance Fabric', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Performance Golf Pants', 'Greyson Men''s Performance Golf Pants in slate gray — a premium athletic trouser from the luxury golf brand. Size 34 waist. Made from a smooth, lightweight synthetic performance fabric with a refined look. Features include a flat front, zip fly, side slash pockets, zippered back pockets, and adjustable button tabs at the hem. Made in China.

Condition: Excellent used condition. No visible stains, tears, or signs of wear — only light storage creases.', '[]'::jsonb, '181137', '{"Fit":["Regular"],"Size":["34"],"Type":["Pants"],"Brand":["Greyson"],"Color":["Gray"],"Style":["Performance Golf Pants"],"Season":["Spring","Summer","Fall"],"Closure":["Button","Zip Fly"],"Pattern":["Solid"],"Vintage":["No"],"Features":["Zippered Pockets","Button Closure","Performance Fabric","Flat Front"],"Handmade":["No"],"Occasion":["Activewear"],"Size Type":["Regular"],"Department":["Men"],"Front Type":["Flat Front"],"Waist Size":["34"],"Fabric Type":["Performance Fabric"],"Country of Origin":["China"],"Performance/Activity":["Golf"]}'::jsonb, '2026-06-16 22:34:32.112894+00');

