('00fd77db-7b67-5d03-82be-d6c404e74b68', '377f5618-6ae8-50e1-8f59-8197dc1caf4f', 'd54d2cc8-aa82-4a95-ad3b-e899d7a83454', 'ebay', '327232882202', 'https://www.ebay.com/itm/327232882202', '45.5', '2026-06-26 03:35:08.465+00', true, 'Vuori Women''s Jogger Sweatpants Size M Gray Recycled Polyester Drawstring', 'Vuori jogger-style sweatpants in a heathered gray colorway. Made from 89% recycled polyester and 11% elastane for a soft, stretchy feel. Features an elasticized waistband with a woven drawstring and ribbed ankle cuffs. Size M. Manufactured in Vietnam. Item appears in good used condition with no visible damage, staining, or heavy wear noted in the photos.

View the full condition certificate: https://gradethread.com/cert/f3b8cd65-35b0-5ee1-8c56-84fafce21e3b', 'active', '0', '0', NULL, false, '1', false, 'USED_EXCELLENT', 'gradethread', '2026-06-26 02:44:39.854832+00'),
('b6b7a33f-6547-5286-82ce-92d444848659', 'b8bd2e56-0514-5639-b6a5-58ec94dc0ee2', 'd54d2cc8-aa82-4a95-ad3b-e899d7a83454', 'ebay', NULL, NULL, '47.99', '2026-06-13 12:14:27.664788+00', true, 'ME+EM White Tonal Stripe Pintuck Long-Sleeve Shirt — UK 8 / US S / EU 36', 'Classic ME+EM long-sleeve button-up shirt in crisp white with a subtle tonal stripe and elegant pintuck detail at the front. Features a spread collar, double/French cuffs, and a curved hem. Made in Turkey; care label advises gentle machine wash or dry clean.

