• Size: UK 8 / US S / EU 36
• Color: White
• Style: Tonal stripe, pintuck front, double cuffs
• Measured flat: ~19" chest (pit-to-pit), ~27" length

Condition: Good pre-owned condition. No visible stains or damage; light storage creasing only.', 'draft', '0', '0', NULL, false, '1', false, 'USED_EXCELLENT', 'gradethread', '2026-06-13 12:14:27.664788+00'),
('0fbef705-2376-5149-9043-9da94e2776dc', 'feb73f15-70ea-5ef6-97be-61003813752f', 'd54d2cc8-aa82-4a95-ad3b-e899d7a83454', 'ebay', '327232443716', 'https://www.ebay.com/itm/327232443716', '41.5', '2026-06-25 21:07:59.095+00', true, 'Lululemon Men''s Khaki Chino Shorts Size 33', 'Lululemon men''s performance chino shorts in khaki/tan. Size 33 waist. Features a smooth, lightweight synthetic performance fabric, flat-front styling, button-and-zip fly closure, two front slash pockets, two back welt pockets, and belt loops. Great for golf, travel, or everyday wear.

Condition: Good used condition. No visible stains or tears. Minor surface scuffing on the metal button. Ready to wear.', 'active', '0', '0', NULL, false, '1', false, 'USED_EXCELLENT', 'gradethread', '2026-06-25 21:07:44.527269+00'),
